      "body": "  These \"cache reject\" attributes should likely be allowed in a Disconnect-Request packet, too.\n\nThat way you can not only kick someone offline, but also keep them offline. \n\nUsing Disconnect-Request avoids another round of authentication.  It's an optimization, and not strictly required.",
